* Comparator: thresholds on a slow triangle
.include "../../models/logic.lib"
XU32 inp inn out vdd 0 MCP656X
Vdd vdd 0 3.3
Vinn inn 0 0.5
Vinp inp 0 PWL(0 0.48 2e-05 0.48 0.00202 0.52 0.00402 0.48)
Rload out 0 1meg
* the run starts at rest
.ic v(xu32.h)=0
.options method=gear
.options trtol=1
.options itl4=100
.options abstol=1e-9
.control
tran 5e-07 0.00404
.endc
.end
